answer:
استخدم zip:
for name, score in zip(names, scores):
    print(name, score)

en.answer:
Use zip:
for name, score in zip(names, scores):
    print(name, score)

answer:
استخدم isinstance (تتعامل مع الوراثة):
if isinstance(x, (int, float)):
    print("رقم")

en.answer:
Use isinstance (it understands inheritance):
if isinstance(x, (int, float)):
    print("a number")

answer:
استخدم class مع __init__:
class User:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name
    def greet(self):
        return f"مرحباً {self.name}"

en.answer:
Use class with __init__:
class User:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name
    def greet(self):
        return f"Hello {self.name}"

answer:
ضع الفئة الأم بين القوسين:
class Admin(User):
    def __init__(self, name, level):
        super().__init__(name)
        self.level = level

en.answer:
Put the parent in parentheses:
class Admin(User):
    def __init__(self, name, level):
        super().__init__(name)
        self.level = level

